{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213430","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1421343001:1":{"text":"抱歉，我无意冒犯，我是根据祖娅之前留给我的地图过来的。","source_cn":"抱歉，我无意冒犯，我是根据祖娅之前留给我的地图过来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B4BD4DA456CA5D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421343002:1":{"text":"本来是想事先在这里与你们联络一下，没想到这里居然有别人在。","source_cn":"本来是想事先在这里与你们联络一下，没想到这里居然有别人在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4A1F9CD7B30066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421343003:1":{"text":"说什么重建帝国之类的……我刚一露面她就突然对我攻击。","source_cn":"说什么重建帝国之类的……我刚一露面她就突然对我攻击。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC74313898979FF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421343004:1":{"text":"真是多亏你了，因度厄，幸好你把她制服了。","source_cn":"真是多亏你了，因度厄，幸好你把她制服了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C79A4C6EC65F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421343005:1":{"text":"所以，小丫头，你就是伊娜？","source_cn":"所以，小丫头，你就是伊娜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4929F6BEBB5FC91D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421343006:1":{"text":"哈！你们捆住我的手脚，但捆不住矮人智慧的光芒！","source_cn":"哈！你们捆住我的手脚，但捆不住矮人智慧的光芒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387BA073B5FB89CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421343007:1":{"text":"这里所有的机关我都已经改造过了！我刚刚已经按下了开关！","source_cn":"这里所有的机关我都已经改造过了！我刚刚已经按下了开关！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20971DBEC6962849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421343008:1":{"text":"只要我不亲手操作，这里立刻就会爆炸！","source_cn":"只要我不亲手操作，这里立刻就会爆炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB7BD2025EB6EDF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421343009:1":{"text":"伊娜！你、你怎么……怎么办，这怎么办？！伊娜绝对不会吹牛，她说改了就一定改过……","source_cn":"伊娜！你、你怎么……怎么办，这怎么办？！伊娜绝对不会吹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB85A30BCEDC37723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421343010:1":{"text":"我们同归于尽吧，为了尊严与骄傲——","source_cn":"我们同归于尽吧，为了尊严与骄傲——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F2BE7816E2A77D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421343011:1":{"text":"哈，可笑，在我的地盘，用我的材料，改造我的机关，炸我的人？","source_cn":"哈，可笑，在我的地盘，用我的材料，改造我的机关，炸我的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DAF925C45DA0D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"},"speaker:伊娜":{"text":"伊娜","source":"伊娜","status":"source"},"speaker:海拉":{"text":"海拉","source":"海拉","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}}